  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">chicken burrito is your ticket to a cozy kitchen fiesta, with tender chicken thighs marinated in zesty lime and smoky paprika, then tucked beside creamy mashed avocado and bright salsa fresca. Each bite bursts with sweet corn, black beans, and lusciously golden sautéed onions, plus a sprinkle of sharp cheddar inside a pillowy warm tortilla. Fresh cilantro and a dash of chili powder bring sunny lift, while a splash of tangy yogurt keeps everything cool and balanced. Easy to make and big on comfort, chicken burrito turns any weeknight into a flavorful celebration.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-chicken-burrito\">Why You’ll Love This Chicken Burrito</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-the-ultimate-chicken-burrito-at-home\">How to Make the Ultimate Chicken Burrito at Home</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-chicken-burrito\">Pro Tips for Making Chicken Burrito</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-chicken-burrito\">How to Serve this Chicken Burrito</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-chicken-burrito\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Chicken Burrito</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It&#8217;s packed with flavor that will make your taste buds dance.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customizable to fit your dietary preferences and cravings.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect for meal prep, making weeknight dinners a breeze.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to make, so you can whip it up in no time!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-5331\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"5331